{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass on the eighth day.</b> Of the inauguration; it is the first of the month of Nisan, on which the Tabernacle was erected on that day, and it took ten crowns of distinction, in the order of the world." "<b>And to the elders of Israel.</b> To make them hear that by decree of the Divine Word Aaron enters and serves in the high priesthood, and they will not say he entered on his own (Tanchuma)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:32.339904351Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}